"""Precomputed Kang-style NSDF -> shared initial/VCT -> OPS+GDPS and CAD-BPG.

Use NSDF from STL_SDF_paper.py (grid_sign required).
SDF interpolation uses trilinear grid samples; non-band nodes get signed
saturation at +/-band_width, NOT exact geometric distances. This is a
numerical approximation and NOT a direct STL geometric distance oracle.
Method kernels are preserved from the two user-supplied Neuralangelo codes.
No Neuralangelo checkpoint or GPU is required.
"""
import argparse
